{"text": "spacious", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">spacious</i>, from Old French <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fro\">spacios</i>, from Latin <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"la\">spati\u014dsus</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Adjective", "definitions": [{"definition": "Having plenty of space; roomy.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "Large in expanse.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["IPA", "/\u02c8spe\u026a\u0283\u0259s/"]]}